es. It -- you know, you look at it from so many different angles and you know, as I've been bringing up throughout the night tonight, I mean, all these radical positions, she's gone 50-plus days without answering those questions. We have early voting starting in the state in a week, and is this something that you have to communicate through ads? Is this something that -- I mean, she -- they're saying that they want a second debate. I don't -- I don't know if I trust anything that they say to be honest. I mean, she told a lot of lies tonight about President Trump.\par \par \uc2 L. TRUMP: Yes. And unfortunately, they didn't they didn't fact-check a single one of those, Sean. Imagine that. Look, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  would love another debate. He would love three debates because that's traditional what you do for presidential elections. Obviously, we know that that's probably not going to happen. But what we're going to do is we're going to have to talk to the American people.\par \par \uc2 And guess who's here? \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  himself came because he couldn't actually talk to the American people.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: He's going to take your time, but I hate that.\par \par \uc2 L. TRUMP: Yes, that's OK. He can have it.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: All right, we'll talk with President Trump in just a second. But the former president called out Kamala's election year flip-flops and even joked about sending her a MAGA hat. Take a look.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : We hardly make chip anymore because of philosophies like they have and policies like they have. I don't say her because she has no policy. Everything that she believed three years ago and four years ago is out the window. She's going to my philosophy now. In fact, I was going to send her a MAGA hat. She's gone to my philosophy. But if she ever got elected, she'd change it, and it will be the end of our country.\par \par \uc2 She's a Marxist. Everybody knows she's a Marxist. Her 