t's right. That's right. And she wants to confiscate guns.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: And you did call her out in a lot of it.\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : I called her out on everything that you said. I think I got everything out. Now, with all of that being said, I was amazed because I really thought that'd be fair. I have to say, CNN a few weeks ago was sort of fair against Biden, but this one was stacked. I figured it would be after watching 100 percent positive coverage of her. And she's done a terrible job as vice president.\par \par \uc2 And look, she's the worst vice president we've ever had. She was the border czar. The worst border ever in the history of the world not just in our country. And he's the worst president we've ever had.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: So, she --\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : They're destroying our country.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: I'm very aware. And if we look at her tax plan which is OK, price gauging or gouging and the largest tax increase not only in American history but world history. Her campaign is saying tonight, \uc2 Washington Post\uc2  is reporting that she wants a second debate. What's your answer?\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : That's because she lost. She wants it because she lost.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Do you have an answer?\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: Well, I don't know. I have to think about it. But if you won the debate, I sort of think maybe I shouldn't do it. Why should I do another debate? She immediately said we want another debate. That's -- you know what happens when you're a praise fighter and you lose, you immediately want a new fight.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: You want a rematch.\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : You want a rematch. The guy that won is sort of happy and thinking about it.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Would you be inclined to say yes or you're --\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : Maybe if it was an a fair network I would do that. But --\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: I think let Hannity moderate it.\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : Yes. No, I think --\par 