ght it was brilliant. I just thought good on you, Donald. I'm the rocket man. Yes. Donald has always been a fan of mine and he's been to my concerts many, many times.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: Dana, isn't this what we want in life?\par \par \uc2 PERINO: Hey, as Michael Jordan said, Republicans buy sneakers too.\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: Yes.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: And also, Little Rocket Man was my -- maybe my only nickname that I loved. I thought it was brilliant as well. Elton John and I were like this.\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: Jesse, are you pro-Little Rocket Man?\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: Yes, I am. Love the art and hate the artist. For instance, if Bernie Sanders was to buy my book, Get It Together -- still available while books are sold -- because he can appreciate good writing, then yes, I'd appreciate Bernie. Bernie can appreciate my great writing but despise me individually.\par \par \uc2 It takes a very mature and discerning and some would say elevated human consciousness to have that sort of opinion.\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: What do you think, Judge?\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: Yes. I really liked it. I mean, it was just so comforting. I was -- you know, when I first saw the headline, I'm like oh, boy, does Elton John trash \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 ? And the answer was no. It was like, you know, I like him. And then the other thing that I wanted to make note of is that, you know, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  -- you know, he knows pop culture. He really does.\par \par \uc2 I mean, when it was a celebrity and running the hotels and he had all kinds of stars singing at the hotels -- I mean, this is a guy who understands celebrity, he understands pop culture. It's not fake like it is with some other people who running for president.\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: Greg?\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: Well, you know, I think it's refreshing a lot of a -- lot of these entertainers have such huge egos and that's what makes them so antagonistic towards Trump. I'm not a huge fan of El