ardworking American patriots. That's what you are.\par \par \uc2 (CHEERING)\par \par \uc2 (APPLAUSE)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : It's coming. It's coming. Listen to this, 67 days. Wow.\par \par \uc2 (CHEERING)\par \par \uc2 (APPLAUSE)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: Sixty-seven days from now, we're going to win Pennsylvania. We're going to defeat comrade \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 . Did you see her?\par \par \uc2 (BOOING)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : Did you see her last night? Did you see her last night? I don't know.\par \par \uc2 You think she's going to be able to handle President Xi? I don't know. I don't think so. China, North Korea, Russia? I don't know. But we're going to win back the White House. We're going to make this country greater than it's ever been.\par \par \uc2 (CHEERING)\par \par \uc2 (APPLAUSE)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : And everyone here today is part of the greatest political movement in the history of our country, you know, the make America great again, MAGA.\par \par \uc2 (CHEERING)\par \par \uc2 (APPLAUSE)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : And, whoa, look at all of the fake news. They got a -- they got a lot of fake news back there.\par \par \uc2 (BOOING)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : That's a lot of fake news, David. That's a lot of people, some I like, about 7 percent, and some I don't like.\par \par \uc2 (LAUGHTER)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: No, that's a lot.\par \par \uc2 But when I say the greatest political movement in the history of our country, if I say something even slightly wrong, they give me 12 Pinocchios, right, 12 Pinocchios?\par \par \uc2 (LAUGHTER)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: No, we can't say anything even a little bit wrong. I can't even joke. When I used to show Biden couldn't find the stairs off the stairway, they'd say Trump couldn't find it. I would say, they took it. And they would say I couldn't, when different things -- the worst thing you can do with them is sarcasm, because it doesn't work with the fake news.\par \par \uc2 (LAUGHTER)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 :