rica healthy again.\par \par \uc2 (CHEERING)\par \par \uc2 (APPLAUSE)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : You know, we're a nation that is not doing well in a lot of ways, and we're not doing so well with health, but we're going to solve a lot of those problems, I think, over the next short period of time.\par \par \uc2 A lot of it's common. A lot of that's common sense to it. It's all common sense when you get right down to it. But we're going to get toxic chemicals out of our environment, and we're going to get them out of our food supply.\par \par \uc2 (CHEERING)\par \par \uc2 (APPLAUSE)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : We're going to get them out of our bodies. We will get them out of our body, right? Right?\par \par \uc2 With victory this fall, we will enact this pro-family agenda, and we will bring back the American dream bigger, better, and stronger than ever before. They never talk about the American dream. They never mention it. They don't talk about the American flag.\par \par \uc2 By the way, the American flag, we got some of the greatest congressmen warriors here that you have anywhere. And, Congressmen, go to Congress soon, like immediately, but soon. We should give a one-year sentence in jail to anybody that burns the American flag.\par \par \uc2 (CHEERING)\par \par \uc2 (APPLAUSE)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : We should do that.\par \par \uc2 (CHEERING)\par \par \uc2 (APPLAUSE)\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: Mike -- do it, Mike, right? Do it.\par \par \uc2 AUDIENCE: USA! USA! USA!\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : That looked so bad at the Democrat National -- I always call it Democrat. They want it to be called Democratic. I said ten change your name. They don't change their name. Sounds worse, so I use it.\par \par \uc2 But at the Democrat National Convention, I watched those American flags burning all over the place. I think it's a disgrace. And they said it's unconstitutional to stop it. Like hell it is, OK? Like hell it is.\par \par \uc2 (CHEERING)\par \par \uc2 (APPLAUSE)\par \par \u