p and tied. Lot of women here wearing white tonight. Why? The freedom that they want to talk about is the freedom to choose to have an abortion.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: So, that's --\par \par \uc2 PERINO: And --\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: -- that's all it is, really --\par \par \uc2 (CROSSTALK)\par \par \uc2 PERINO: -- they're also lying when they say that \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  wants a federal ban on abortion. He's never said that.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Even they've been fact checking on this, even from not conservative sources --\par \par \uc2 PERINO: It hasn't stopped them from saying it.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: But also, the same thing with Project 2025. Even CNN had to fact check the speaker who said, oh, he wrote the book -- and she's like no, no, he didn't write the book. And he's repeatedly --\par \par \uc2 PERINO: Yes.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: -- said that these key parts of Project 2025, he personally does not agree with, and they keep saying it.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: For what they wanted -- needed to accomplish at this convention, they've done it. These people are enthusiastic. They're donating money. They're going to knock on all the doors and post all the TikTok's, and they're going to do the thing. But it's still a tight race.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Yes, the betting markets are interesting. Some of them are moving closer to Trump, but she's still maybe a smidge ahead --\par \par \uc2 PERINO: Yes, but it gets harder, starting for her tomorrow morning.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: It does. Dana, great to see --\par \par \uc2 PERINO: Yes, thanks.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: -- you as well. All right. Democrats showing some, maybe less than genuine empathy at the DNC, we're going to explain it, next.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Of all the dumb things \uc2 Tim Walz\uc2  has said in the past month, this was one of the dumbest.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 WALZ: I grew up in Butte, Nebraska, a town of 400 people. I had 24 