ith. Both sides got a little crazy on their sides, and this is my -- this is my party's crazy.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: Judge Jeanine.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: OK, overreaction. You've got a gender-neutral Islamic prayer room. What a crazy oxymoron, a gender-neutral Islamic prayer room? I mean, you go over there, in five minutes you're neutralized literally.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: What? Hey, walk me through the prayer room, Judge, because I don't understand this. So, if it's a general neutral Islamic prayer room, because you have the rugs, does that mean this is for transgender Muslims or is this for male and female Muslims to pray together?\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: It's everybody. It's the whole crew. And the problem is that, you know, that people are -- I mean, they change from day to day. So, you never know how they're going to identify. But the bottom line is if you identify as any of these people, you're going to get killed when you go over there.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: Jesse, I think you should send Johnny over there tonight. We need a live report.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: He's already on the waiting list for the vasectomy, so fun.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: I know. All right, "ONE MORE THING" up next.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: It is time now for "ONE MORE THING." Greg?\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: Oh, tonight, we got a banger. Charles Payne, Joe Machi, Timpf, and Tyrus. That's live 11:00 p.m. I swear, live at 11:00.\par \par \uc2 Hey, let's play a new game. It's Greg's what's on the roof? OK, roll the tape. All right, Judge, what's on the roof?\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: Superman.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: All right, Jesse, what's on the roof?\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: Bird.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: Dana, what's on the roof?\par \par \uc2 PERINO: Dog.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: Harold?\par \par \uc2 FORD JR.: A bear.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: All right, roll the tape.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: Oh.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: A dog.\par \par \uc2 FORD JR.: A dog.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: