gan Paul has more than 1.8 million views after launching less than 24 hours ago. A 26- year-old at the birthday bash says he is confident Trump is the clear choice.\par \par \uc2 ADAM TRACY, TRUMP SUPPORTER: I think a lot of people my age are more secretly voting for Trump. I think they like to put on a persona of saying that they're voting for Biden.\par \par \uc2 MCNICHOLL: As Trump taps into young voters, President Biden appears to be gaining with older Americans. According to the latest FOX News poll, Biden is taking a six-point lead amongst registered voters aged 65 or older. This weekend, Trump heads to battleground Michigan to court black voters. Speaking at a Turning Point USA event in Detroit, a solidly Democratic city where President Biden won by 94 percent in 2020.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO TAPE)\par \par \uc2 MCNICHOLL (on camera): And a six-layer cake with a MAGA hat on top was just rolled out on stage. Former president \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  is expected to address this sold-out crowd in just 30 minutes. Trace?\par \par \uc2 GALLAGHER: Danamarie McNicholl live forever us in Palm Beach. Danamarie, thank you.\par \par \uc2 As Jacqui Heinrich mentioned, President Biden is skipping out tomorrow's Swiss organized global peace summit on the Ukraine war. He instead will attend a glitzy Hollywood fundraiser where he will mingle with some big stars and is expected to rake in millions of dollars in campaign cash. National correspondent William la jeunesse has a preview from Los Angeles.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO TAPE)\par \par \uc2 SARAH BRYNER, OPER SECRETS: You're not looking at \uc2 George Clooney\uc2  for voting advice.\par \par \uc2 WILLIAM LA JEUNESSE, FOX NEWS NATIONAL CORRESPONDENT: But \uc2 George Clooney\uc2  has something others don't. This Saturday He and Julia Roberts activate the Hollywood money machine for President Biden.\par \par \uc2 JOE BIDEN\uc2 , (D) PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES: That's character in real life, and that's \uc2 George Clooney