ground. The only redeeming quality left is the weather.\par \par \uc2 I don't know, Sean. You're in Florida. I'm in Tennessee. I think the weather is pretty great here and the freedom's even better.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Yeah. Tudor, I mean, I can't add to what she's saying. It's nuts. It's insane and she talked about older people even having sex with you know 14-year-old kids and that's okay, no, it's not. And she really touched on every topic.\par \par \uc2 She's obviously doesn't sound politically conservative, but she's just against crazy and that's what the left has become, insane.\par \par \uc2 TUDOR DIXON, PODCAST HOST: Right, and I thought it was interesting that she pointed out on paper, I'm one of them. I'm everything they want. I should be the person they're courting. However, they've gone too far beyond that.\par \par \uc2 And I think that what we heard was a mom, and that was what fascinated me, a mom, because she constantly was talking about my kid or if a child wants to do this, I'm concerned about their safety.\par \par \uc2 And I think as someone who as a child suffered from childhood obesity, came out of that, she's a fitness guru. She has -- I mean, she's life goals for me. When I look at her, I'm like that's who I want to be.\par \par \uc2 And yet she has watched society say, you know what? The swimsuit model can be obese now, the boy can -- that can run against the girl and take all her records, and everything that she has achieved in life with health and fitness can be taken away by society that says, we should look at these people and say, this is what we want. This is beautiful. We're so happy.\par \par \uc2 And she says, you know what, I'm just done with it. I want my kids to be safe. I want my kids' bodies to be safe until they grow up. I don't want them to be influenced by this.\par \par \uc2 And she left because of it. And I think it's kind of beautiful to have someone brave enough to speak out about it, especially as a mom and especially as someone who has fought so hard for health, for not only herself but for other people for decades. She's an amazing woman and it's wonderful to hear her say this.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Yeah. I don't know. I just hope she doesn't, you know, vote Democratic in Florida when she -- when she gets here. Otherwise, welcome to Florida, Jillian Michaels, I'll say that, Tomi. It doesn't sound like she's -- she's going to vote in those policies in the future.\par \par \uc2 All right. Thank you both.\par \par \uc2 When we come back, straight ahead, more "Hannity".\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Ninety-five days early voting starts in Pennsylvania, 144 days until to election day. Yeah, this election matters.\par \par \uc2 All right. That's all the time we have left this evening. As always, thank you for being with us, making the show possible, Please set your DVR so you never, ever, ever, ever, ever miss an episode of "Hannity".\par \par \uc2 Let not your hearts be troubled. Why? Greg Gutfeld is standing by to put a smile on your face. Have a great night.\par \par \uc2 END\par \par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2024 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2024 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All  materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not  be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast  without the prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You  may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from  copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 Document SHAN000020240614ek6d00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Presumptive Nominees Draw Attention On Trips; Trump Shows Support For Hogan; Trump Comments On Hunter Biden Conviction; Biden Denies Potential Commutation Of Hunter Sentence; Biden And Zelenskyy Meet Amid Rising Russian Tensions; Justices To Decide On Emergency Abortion Process; Jihadist Sympathizer Charged With Weapons