ere's your admission that there's a problem, Laura. I'll leave it there.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Three of him is even more creepier than one of him. All right. Raymond, thank you so much. I'm still trying to dissect some of those outfits.\par \par \uc2 That's it for us tonight. Make sure to follow me on \uc2 Instagram\uc2 . I want you to send me photos of your pets watching the Angle. I kid you not, we have a great photo on \uc2 Instagram\uc2 . Jesse Watters takes it all from here.\par \par \uc2 END\par \par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2024 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2024 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All  materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not  be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast  without the prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You  may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from  copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 Document INGANG0020240509ek5800001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Democrats Attempt To Make Abortion A Top Issue\b0\par\par\uc2 Sean Hannity, Gregg Jarrett, Matt Finn, Ari Fleischer, Kellyanne  Conway, Mike Huckabee \par \uc2 7,683 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 May 2024\par \uc2 Fox News: Hannity\par \uc2 SHAN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2024 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2024 ASC Services II Media, LLC.  All materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast without the prior written permission of ASC Services II Media, LLC. You may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 SEAN HANNITY\uc2 , FOX NEWS HOST: And welcome to "Hannity".\par \par \uc2 At this hour, we continue to monitor the repulsive anti-Israel protests going on around the country. Last night, far-left ri