imagine that. Now during an explosive town hall, the so-called worst mayor in America confronted by her constituents. Here's a quick preview.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 RESIDENT: Tiffany, to everybody, every resident, I'm sorry, I apologize if I seemed irate. I had my radiation today. I have cancer, of course I do.\par \par \uc2 Tiffany stole money from a cancer foundation. How dare you? How dare you steal? And I helped you with your campaign. How dare you steal from us?\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: It even got more wild. We'll have more highlights coming up later on.\par \par \uc2 Also, guess what? Town hall Pete, Mayor Pete is trying his luck as an electric car and truck salesperson. California passed a new law that drives up inflation even more. We'll get to that.\par \par \uc2 And two breaking news stories about illegal immigrants, violent crime. It should shock every American to its core. Why it's not, I don't know.\par \par \uc2 But, first, it is a tough pill to swallow for so many on the left. You see that, 215 days, this is an inflection point for this country. This is a tipping point for this country. There is a very real possibility that \uc2 Donald J. Trump\uc2  can be your president-elect. Anything can happen in 215 days, but Trump is now consistently pulling ahead of Biden in almost every single battleground state.\par \par \uc2 According to a brand new "Wall Street Journal" poll just out -- well, Trump is leading in six out of seven swing states, up by five in the important state of Arizona, four in Nevada, three in Michigan, three in Pennsylvania, one in Georgia, that needs to get larger, six in North Carolina. And in the seventh state, Wisconsin, Trump and Biden are tied.\par \par \uc2 Let us be clear, very clear, these results are not unusual. In poll after poll, President Trump is beating Biden nationwide and beating him in what we believe will be the key swing states. But according to Dr. Jill Biden, well, the polls don't really exist. They are but a mere figment of your imagination. Take a look.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 DR. JILL BIDEN, U.S. FIRST LADY: People know the choice of this election. They can choose chaos, or they can choose, you know, steady wisdom experience.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE: So there's not a part of you that's a little worried because it seemed to be off kilter a little bit.\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: No, no, no. I feel that Joe will be reelected.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: But when these polls like "The Wall Street Journal" one land in the White House and he's losing in all the battleground states --\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: No, he's not losing in all the battleground states.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFEID MALE: All but one.\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: He's coming up and he's -- even or doing better. So, you know what? Once people start to focus in and they see their two choices, it's obvious that Joe will win this election.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: All right.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: I was wondering, maybe you were wondering the same thing -- where was \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  during that discussion?\par \par \uc2 Now, according to \uc2 RNC\uc2  research, think about this, it has been a whopping 279 days since President Joe actually participated in a real live sit down interview. In other words, Joe is back hiding in his basement with a few campaign visits and a lot of fundraisers sprinkled in here there when they can. Now, it's not because he doesn't have the time because Joe frequently spends entire days without anything on his public calendar.\par \par \uc2 This lie the White House has been telling us he gets more done in an hour than the most Americans get done in a day, that's a lie. Anyway, it's pretty unheard of that, light schedule for any president, especially if you're running for reelection.\par \par \uc2 Now even when Joe does have a teleprompter and a friendly audience, it is - - well, always a struggle. Here is but the latest example of your president. Take a look.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 JOE BIDEN\uc2 , PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES: I'm proud -- I'm proud of my administration taking on big pharma, the most significant ways ever, and it wouldn't have done without Bernie and Bernie got it, you know, look -- but the Republicans were able to cut back on the fact that only -- they only were not able -- the only thing they couldn't defeat was the seniors. It cuts the deficit by $160 billion.\par \par \uc2 Now this spring is here, the seasons and allergies are on -- upon us.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: For the mumbling, bumbling, stumbling incoherence, I think I need an interpreter because he's now attempting to navigate what has become an increasingly difficult political landscape, The numbers are very clear, they're very consistent, James Carville says they are horrific, horrendous.\par \par \uc2 African Americans, Hispanic Americans, young people all turning on Biden because of, what? His border disaster, horrible economy and inflation, violent crime, people don't have law and order and safety and security.\par \par \uc2 And at the same time, the president's very woke base, they are demanding even more illegal immigration, more spending, more defund, dismantle, reimagine the police and no bail laws. Meanwhile President Biden's support among Muslim voters, that has now bottomed out because of, quote, his assistance to Israel in its war against terrorism in Gaza. As a result, by the way, \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  keeps literally abandoning our number one ally Israel as they are in a real fight for their very survival. If you have friends like Joe, you don't need friends like that.\par \par \uc2 But his critical -- critical voting bloc in states like Michigan, Minnesota, Wisconsin, they are demanding that Joe capitulate to the radicals that run his party. In fact, during last night's Democratic primary